#: ../../source/index.md:1
msgid "hbsaemp"
msgstr "hbsaemp"

#: ../../source/index.md:3
msgid "Hierarchical Bayes small area estimation for Python, built on Bambi, PyMC and ArviZ."
msgstr "Small area estimation dengan hierarchical Bayes untuk Python, dibangun di atas Bambi, PyMC, dan ArviZ."

#: ../../source/index.md:5
msgid "There are two ways to use it, and the documentation is split the same way. Pick one; each track is complete on its own."
msgstr "Ada dua cara memakainya, dan dokumentasinya dibagi dengan cara yang sama. Pilih salah satu; masing-masing jalur lengkap dengan sendirinya."

#: ../../source/index.md:8
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Instalasi"

#: ../../source/index.md:10
msgid "hbsaemp is not on PyPI; install it straight from the GitHub repository."
msgstr "hbsaemp tidak tersedia di PyPI; pasang langsung dari repositori GitHub."

#: ../../source/index.md:17
msgid "Choose a track"
msgstr "Pilih jalur"

#: ../../source/index.md:22
msgid "Python API"
msgstr "API Python"

#: ../../source/index.md:26
msgid "Write the analysis as code. Full control, reproducible scripts and notebooks."
msgstr "Tulis analisis sebagai kode. Kendali penuh, skrip dan notebook yang dapat direproduksi."

#: ../../source/index.md:29
msgid "Graphical interface"
msgstr "Antarmuka grafis"

#: ../../source/index.md:33
msgid "Work through the analysis by clicking. No Python beyond starting the app."
msgstr "Kerjakan analisis dengan mengklik. Tidak perlu Python selain untuk menjalankan aplikasinya."

#: ../../source/index.md:37
msgid "How each track is arranged"
msgstr "Susunan tiap jalur"

#: ../../source/index.md:39
msgid "Every track holds the same four kinds of page."
msgstr "Setiap jalur memuat empat jenis halaman yang sama."

#: ../../source/index.md:41
msgid "**Tutorials** take you through one whole analysis. Read them when you are new."
msgstr "**Tutorials** membawa Anda melalui satu analisis utuh. Bacalah ketika Anda masih baru."

#: ../../source/index.md:42
msgid "**How-to guides** answer one stage at a time. Read them when you are working."
msgstr "**How-to guides** menjawab satu tahap setiap kali. Bacalah ketika Anda sedang bekerja."

#: ../../source/index.md:43
msgid "**Reference** states technical facts. Read it when you need a fact."
msgstr "**Reference** memuat fakta teknis. Bacalah ketika Anda membutuhkan suatu fakta."

#: ../../source/index.md:44
msgid "**Explanation** gives the reasoning. Read it when you want to understand."
msgstr "**Explanation** memberikan alasannya. Bacalah ketika Anda ingin memahami."

#: ../../source/index.md:46
msgid "About the project"
msgstr "Tentang proyek"

#: ../../source/index.md:51
msgid "Authors"
msgstr "Penulis"

#: ../../source/index.md:54
msgid "Who develops hbsaemp."
msgstr "Siapa yang mengembangkan hbsaemp."

#: ../../source/index.md:57
msgid "Citation"
msgstr "Sitasi"

#: ../../source/index.md:60
msgid "How to cite it."
msgstr "Cara mengutipnya."

#: ../../source/index.md:63
msgid "License"
msgstr "Lisensi"

#: ../../source/index.md:66
msgid "GPL-3.0-or-later."
msgstr "GPL-3.0-or-later."

#: ../../source/index.md:69
msgid "References"
msgstr "Referensi"

#: ../../source/index.md:72
msgid "Works cited in these pages."
msgstr "Karya yang dikutip di halaman-halaman ini."

#: ../../source/index.md:76
msgid "The documentation is organised following Diátaxis: Procida, D. (2022, 9 May). *Diátaxis: A systematic approach to technical documentation authoring*. <https://diataxis.fr/>"
msgstr "Dokumentasi ini disusun mengikuti Diátaxis: Procida, D. (2022, 9 Mei). *Diátaxis: A systematic approach to technical documentation authoring*. <https://diataxis.fr/>"

